          "settings": {
            "title": "<b>EXPANDED MATERIALS</b>",
            "text": "<p><br/>Choose from a wider range of inlay options — rare stones, vibrant pigments, and unique blends — giving you more ways to create a truly one-of-a-kind ring.<br/><br/></p>"
